# ===== ACT 6 a simple first recipe =====
th("Let me give you a dead-simple first project, so you are not starting from a blank page.")
th("One pound of soy container wax. One eight ounce jar. One properly sized wick for that jar. And one ounce of fragrance oil, which is a gentle, safe load to start with.")
