th("You let it cool to the fragrance window, you weigh in your oil, and you stir gently for two full minutes so it really binds into the wax.")
th("You let it cool a little more to the pour window, you set your wick straight, and you pour slowly and steadily into a slightly warmed jar.")
th("Then you walk away. You let it sit undisturbed, you let it cure for a week, and the first time you light it and it fills the room, you will be hooked for life.")
th("That is the whole craft, on your very first day. Not a kit with twelve mystery pieces. Just a few good ingredients, treated with care and a little patience.")
